## Logo system

| Tier | File | Use |
|---|---|---|
| Primary ({{ primary_lockup }}) | `{{ prefix }}-primary-color.svg` | website header, documents, print |
| Horizontal | `{{ prefix }}-horizontal-color.svg` | nav bars, email signatures, banners |
| Stacked | `{{ prefix }}-stacked-color.svg` | square placements, packaging, social posts |
{% if has_wordmark %}| Wordmark | `{{ prefix }}-wordmark-color.svg` | when the symbol is already present |
{% endif %}| Mark | `{{ prefix }}-mark-color.svg` | avatars, app icons, favicons over 32 px |
| Small | `{{ prefix }}-small-color.svg` | 33 to 95 px |
| Favicon | `{{ prefix }}-favicon-color.svg` | 32 px and below |

Each tier ships in five variants: `color`, `reverse` (for dark backgrounds; designed, not inverted), `black`, `white`, and `mono`, which inherits `currentColor` from CSS.

